    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulgĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		fulgeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>flashing</i>, <i>glittering</i>, <i>shining</i> (ante- and post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lumina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 363</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acies ornatu fulgida Martis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. in Ruf. 2, 351</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Anthol. Lat. 5, 41,
				15</span></i>.—<i>Comp.</i>: fulgidier
			radio, Ven. Carm. 8, 5 <i>fin.</i></div>
